title: village_elder
tags:
---
It wasn’t always like this.

The woods… they used to sway to a gentle rhythm.  
Now all you hear are ghastly wails.

We lost so many.  
And more vanish every night.

-> What happened?
    <<jump betrayal>>

===
title: betrayal
---
The corruption spread quickly. We never thought the war would reach us so fast.  
The forest died—and what replaced it is sadistic and hungry.

-> Yeah the guard had  me kill some strange trees to enter here.
    <<jump thanks>>

===
title: thanks
---
Then we owe you.

Each one you fell...  
That’s one less nightmare for us.

Every bit of life is swallowed by the darkness.  
Their greed is sickening.

-> What can I do?
    <<jump plea>>

===
title: plea
---
Some villagers were taken alive, but we have no idea what’s become of them.  
The village hasn’t slept since the disappearances.

We don’t know where.

And now... Liri is gone.  
The last child...  
The last piece of my daughter I had.  
She chased a voice into the forest—said she could hear her mom.

-> Don’t worry, I’ll find her.
    <<jump accept>>

===
title: accept
---
Then go with strength.

If there’s anything left of who they were...  
Try to reach it.

<<unlockWeapon>>

-> END
===